<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia says $193.4 mln trade surplus in June.</title>
<headline>Indonesia says $193.4 mln trade surplus in June.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia posted a trade surplus of $193.4 million in June this year against a suplus of $203.1 million in May, Information Minister Harmoko said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Following are the trade figures for June, in millions of dollars, with comparisons for the previous month and a year earlier:</p>
<p>			   June	     May	   June 1995</p>
<p>Trade balance	 +193.4	   +203.1	  -204.9</p>
<p>Exports		4,138.9	  4,075.2	 3,769.6</p>
<p>Imports		3,945.5	  3,872.1	 3,974.5</p>
<p>Oil/gas exports	828.4	    870.5	   858.3</p>
</text>
